Happy Sunday CT❤️‍🔥

What makes Web3 fascinating isn't just the creation of tokens it's watching products get more valuable.

@sleepagotchi is trying to make its $SLEEP network more interactive by making it a wellness product that integrates sleeping routines with artificial intelligence and digital rewards.

@agenticscredit takes a different approach by building infrastructure allowing AI agents to receive and utilize credits depending on their performance and on-chain reputation. The main token here is $CREDIT.

Finally, @vangrid_io is bringing real-life mapping into something interactive thanks to its application, which allows users to make 3D captures, complete quests, and earn points.

Various industries, various products  but one thing in common: development of technology that people could interact with.

